{%- comment -%}
  Seoul Glow Lab - Mobile Navigation Drawer (Fully Customizable)
  All text, URLs, video, quick links, and product limits controlled via Casa Header schema.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} ── Overlay ── {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="casa-drawer-overlay" id="casa-drawer-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

{%- comment -%} ── Drawer Panel ── {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Glass variant suppressed — brand book "two surfaces only" rule.
  The .casa-drawer--glass class chain rendered the panel as a
  translucent light surface using merchant glass tint, breaking
  the white-text-on-Ink contract. The merchant's drawer_glassmorphic
  setting still exists in the schema for backward compatibility but
  no longer affects the visual surface. All chrome stays brand Ink.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="casa-drawer" id="casa-drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Navigation menu" style="--drawer-logo-height: {{ drawer_logo_height | default: 28 }}px;">
  <div class="casa-drawer__frost-cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  {%- comment -%} Header {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="casa-drawer__header">
    {%- comment -%}
      Logo: render drawer_logo_image if set, else main logo_image,
      else the wordmark text. ALL image variants get the same
      brightness/invert filter via CSS (`.casa-drawer__logo-img`)
      so a dark monochrome logo reads as white on the Ink frost.
      The merchant uploads their standard dark logo — no separate
      white asset needed.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign effective_logo = drawer_logo_image | default: logo_image -%}
    <div class="casa-drawer__logo">
      {%- if effective_logo != blank -%}
        {%- liquid
          # sizes: the CSS slot is --drawer-logo-height (always set inline
          # on .casa-drawer, default 28px; width: auto), so slot width =
          # height × aspect ratio. The ≤375px var() fallbacks never fire —
          # the inline custom property always wins. Sizes-less srcset
          # would default the slot to 100vw (Safari 26 intrinsic trap —
          # see snippets/casa-cart-items.liquid).
          # alt is precomputed: a piped fallback inside the arg list
          # (alt: x | default: y) TERMINATES image_tag's args — default
          # swallowed the original loading: 'lazy' (verified missing in
          # shipped HTML), and would swallow sizes the same way.
          assign _dlogo_alt = logo_text | default: shop.name
          assign _dlogo_h = drawer_logo_height | default: 28
          assign _dlogo_slot = _dlogo_h | times: effective_logo.aspect_ratio | ceil
          if _dlogo_slot < 1
            # aspect_ratio unavailable → fall back to the src width so we
            # never emit sizes="0px" (smallest-rendition trap)
            assign _dlogo_slot = 160
          endif
          assign _dlogo_sizes = _dlogo_slot | append: 'px'
        -%}
        {{ effective_logo | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: class: 'casa-drawer__logo-img', alt: _dlogo_alt, loading: 'lazy', widths: '160, 320, 480, 600', sizes: _dlogo_sizes }}
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="casa-drawer__logo-text">{{ logo_text | default: 'SEOUL GLOW LAB' }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <div class="casa-drawer__header-actions">
      {%- comment -%}
        Search lives in the quick-actions row below — removed the
        duplicate header-bar Search button so the drawer doesn't
        show the same affordance twice. Close X stays as the only
        header-bar control.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button class="casa-drawer__close" data-casa-drawer-close aria-label="Close menu">
        {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'close', size: 20 -%}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Scrollable Content {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="casa-drawer__content">

    {%- comment -%}
      Level 1 brand intro — italic-gradient brand-voice headline that
      opens the drawer with a brand moment. Same shimmer treatment as
      the desktop megamenu's featured top-bar. The clamp() font-size
      guarantees one-line fit at the narrowest realistic drawer
      (340px = 308px content area).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="casa-drawer-intro">
      <p class="casa-drawer-intro__headline">Find your <em>light.</em></p>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Quick-actions row — Search · Account · Cart.

      Search and Cart open the SAME UI as the header buttons:
        - Search: opens the <dialog id="search-modal"> (snippet
          search-modal.liquid). Header search uses
          on:click="#search-modal/showDialog" — we use vanilla
          showModal() so it works without Horizon component.
        - Cart: triggers <cart-drawer-component> open. The header
          cart button opens the same drawer.
      Account is a real page (no modal) so it stays a link.

      Each action also closes the drawer first via
      data-casa-drawer-close so it doesn't sit in the way.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="casa-drawer-quick-actions">
      <button type="button" class="casa-drawer-quick-action" aria-label="Search" data-casa-drawer-quick-search>
        {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'search', size: 18 -%}
        <span class="casa-drawer-quick-action__label">Search</span>
      </button>
      <a href="{{ routes.account_url }}" class="casa-drawer-quick-action" aria-label="Account">
        {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'user', size: 18 -%}
        <span class="casa-drawer-quick-action__label">Account</span>
      </a>
      <button type="button" class="casa-drawer-quick-action" data-casa-drawer-quick-cart aria-label="Cart{% if cart.item_count > 0 %}, {{ cart.item_count }} item{% if cart.item_count != 1 %}s{% endif %}{% endif %}">
        {%- comment -%}
          Icon + badge share a positioned wrapper so the count pins to the
          cart glyph's top-right corner (reads as "items in cart"), not the
          grid cell's corner — the centered icon otherwise left the badge
          floating far to the upper-right, detached from the cart.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <span class="casa-drawer-quick-action__icon-wrap">
          {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'cart', size: 18 -%}
          {%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
            <span class="casa-drawer-quick-action__badge" aria-hidden="true">{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </span>
        <span class="casa-drawer-quick-action__label">Cart</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Top-level rows. Each row is a 64pt-min-height button with:
        - 36×36 brand-tinted icon chip on the left
        - Title (17px Inter 600) + sub (12px muted) — both on one line
        - Right chevron
      Tap → drills into Level 2 submenu (data-casa-submenu-open="<handle>"
      is preserved from the previous design so the existing JS handler
      picks them up).

      Title is short (one word) so always fits on one line. Sub is kept
      short by design ("All collections", "86 products", "FAQ & support")
      so no truncation. White-space: nowrap defensive.

      Icon resolution by URL handle / title — falls back to `grid` for
      unknown handles.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="casa-drawer-top-rows">
      {%- for link in linklists[menu].links -%}
        {%- assign _link_url_parts = link.url | split: '/' -%}
        {%- assign _link_handle = _link_url_parts | last | downcase -%}
        {%- assign _link_collection = nil -%}
        {%- if link.type == 'collection_link' and link.object != blank -%}
          {%- assign _link_collection = link.object -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- assign _link_collection = collections[_link_handle] -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- assign _link_title_lc = link.title | downcase | strip -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          Icon resolution priority:
            1. Collection's `casa.icon` metafield (merchant-controlled
               exact match; same pattern as the desktop megamenu).
               Lets the merchant pick any icon per collection in
               Shopify admin without changing code.
            2. Handle / title detection (broad fallback for menus
               that haven't been tagged with the metafield yet).
               More specific matches FIRST (best-sellers, new-arrivals,
               etc.) before generic "shop" fallback so they don't get
               grabbed by the catch-all.
            3. Default: 'grid' (browse-all icon).

          More-specific handle matches go FIRST so they win over
          partial overlaps (e.g. "best-sellers" must match the star
          branch before falling into the shop branch via 'best').
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign _link_icon = 'grid' -%}
        {%- if _link_collection != blank and _link_collection.metafields.sgl.icon != blank -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = _link_collection.metafields.sgl.icon -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'best-seller' or _link_handle contains 'bestseller' or _link_handle contains 'popular' or _link_title_lc contains 'best seller' or _link_title_lc contains 'bestseller' or _link_title_lc contains 'popular' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'star' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'new-arrival' or _link_handle contains 'arrival' or _link_handle == 'new' or _link_handle contains 'whats-new' or _link_title_lc contains 'new arrival' or _link_title_lc contains 'whats new' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'sparkles' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'gift' or _link_handle contains 'perfect-for' or _link_title_lc contains 'gift' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'gift' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'sale' or _link_title_lc contains 'sale' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'tag' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'mirror' or _link_handle contains 'infinity' or _link_title_lc contains 'mirror' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'hexagon' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'neon' or _link_handle contains 'led-sign' or _link_title_lc contains 'neon' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'zap' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'mushroom' or _link_title_lc contains 'mushroom' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'moon' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'bubble' or _link_title_lc contains 'bubble' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'sparkles' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'lighting' or _link_handle contains 'lamp' or _link_title_lc contains 'lighting' or _link_title_lc contains 'lamp' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'lamp' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'reward' or _link_handle contains 'loyalty' or _link_handle contains 'smile' or _link_title_lc contains 'reward' or _link_title_lc contains 'loyalty' -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Rewards / loyalty programs (Smile.io renders an anchor
            with handle "#smile-home" — without this branch it
            would fall into the home-decor branch below because
            the handle contains 'home').
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'award' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'home-decor' or _link_handle contains 'decor' or _link_handle contains 'furniture' or _link_title_lc contains 'home decor' or _link_title_lc contains 'decor' or _link_title_lc contains 'furniture' -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Home Decor uses `layers` (a stacked-polygons abstract)
            instead of `home`. At 18×18 the standard Feather home
            icon's inner door rectangle reads as a second small
            house, so the row visually looks like townhouses
            rather than a single home. layers signals "curated
            objects" which fits the category better and reads
            cleanly at small sizes.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'layers' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'home' or _link_title_lc contains 'home' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'home' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'accessor' or _link_handle contains 'accent' or _link_title_lc contains 'accessor' or _link_title_lc contains 'accent' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'box' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'help' or _link_handle contains 'support' or _link_handle contains 'faq' or _link_title_lc contains 'help' or _link_title_lc contains 'support' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'headphones' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'all-product' or _link_handle == 'all' or _link_handle contains 'shop-all' or _link_title_lc == 'shop all' or _link_title_lc == 'all products' or _link_title_lc == 'shop' -%}
          {%- assign _link_icon = 'grid' -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} One-line subtitle: products_count if collection link, otherwise short genre copy {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign _link_sub = '' -%}
        {%- assign _link_count = 0 -%}
        {%- if _link_collection != blank -%}
          {%- assign _link_count = _link_collection.all_products_count | default: _link_collection.products_count -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if _link_count > 0 -%}
          {%- assign _link_sub = _link_count | append: ' products' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle contains 'help' or _link_title_lc contains 'help' -%}
          {%- assign _link_sub = 'FAQ & support' -%}
        {%- elsif _link_handle == 'all' or _link_title_lc contains 'shop' -%}
          {%- assign _link_sub = 'All collections' -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if link.links.size > 0 -%}
          <button type="button" class="casa-drawer-top-row" data-casa-submenu-open="{{ link.handle }}" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="casa-submenu-{{ link.handle }}">
            <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__icon">
              {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: _link_icon, size: 18 -%}
            </span>
            <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__text">
              <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__title">{{ link.title }}</span>
              {%- if _link_sub != blank -%}
                <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__sub">{{ _link_sub }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
              {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 16 -%}
            </span>
          </button>
        {%- else -%}
          <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="casa-drawer-top-row">
            <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__icon">
              {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: _link_icon, size: 18 -%}
            </span>
            <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__text">
              <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__title">{{ link.title }}</span>
              {%- if _link_sub != blank -%}
                <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__sub">{{ _link_sub }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <span class="casa-drawer-top-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
              {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 16 -%}
            </span>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Secondary Menu (extra pages: About, Contact, FAQ, etc.) {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if drawer_secondary_menu != blank and linklists[drawer_secondary_menu].links.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="casa-drawer__divider"></div>
      <div class="casa-drawer__secondary-nav">
        {%- if drawer_secondary_title != blank -%}
          <div class="casa-drawer__secondary-title">{{ drawer_secondary_title }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="casa-drawer__secondary-links">
          {%- for link in linklists[drawer_secondary_menu].links -%}
            <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="casa-drawer__secondary-link">
              <span>{{ link.title }}</span>
              {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 14 -%}
            </a>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Footer {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="casa-drawer__footer">
    {%- comment -%}
      Locale row — tappable button that opens the shared
      casa-localization-drawer (the same drawer the header locale
      button uses). aria-label="Country and language" is the hook
      the existing header script wires up — it'll close this drawer
      first, wait for the slide-out, then open the locale drawer.
      Compact one-line treatment so it earns its footprint as a
      control, not as a passive label.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <button type="button" class="casa-drawer-locale-footer" aria-label="Country and language">
      <span class="casa-drawer-locale-footer__text">{{ cart.currency.iso_code }} · {{ localization.language.iso_code | upcase }} · {{ localization.country.name | default: 'Worldwide' }}</span>
      <span class="casa-drawer-locale-footer__chevron" aria-hidden="true">
        {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 14 -%}
      </span>
    </button>

    {%- comment -%}
      Social URLs mirrored from sections/footer-group.json `casa_footer.social_*`.
      Seoul: values mirror the footer-group.json social-links block
      (only Instagram is set there; blank entries are skipped below).
      To change a social URL: update BOTH this snippet and footer-group.json.
      The drawer is rendered from header-group so it can't read footer section settings directly.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign _social_ig = 'https://www.instagram.com/seoulglowlab/'
      assign _social_tt = ''
      assign _social_pi = ''
      assign _social_fb = ''
      assign _social_yt = ''
    -%}
    <div class="casa-drawer__social">
      {%- if _social_ig != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ _social_ig }}" class="casa-drawer__social-link" aria-label="Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'instagram', size: 20 -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if _social_tt != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ _social_tt }}" class="casa-drawer__social-link" aria-label="TikTok" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'tiktok', size: 20 -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if _social_pi != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ _social_pi }}" class="casa-drawer__social-link" aria-label="Pinterest" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'pinterest', size: 20 -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if _social_fb != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ _social_fb }}" class="casa-drawer__social-link" aria-label="Facebook" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'facebook', size: 20 -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if _social_yt != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ _social_yt }}" class="casa-drawer__social-link" aria-label="YouTube" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'youtube', size: 20 -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <p class="casa-drawer__copyright">&copy; {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ logo_text | default: 'Seoul Glow Lab' }}. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%}
  Resolve "show badges" once: section override > theme setting.
  Passed to every submenu panel render so the merchant has a single
  toggle without each panel re-resolving.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if submenu_show_badges_override -%}
  {%- assign _submenu_show_badges = submenu_show_badges -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign _submenu_show_badges = settings.card_show_badges -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Featured banner + products list visibility — section-level toggles
  default to true. Per-link suppression still possible via collection
  metafields (casa.hide_submenu_featured / casa.hide_submenu_products),
  resolved inside the panel snippet.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if submenu_show_featured == nil -%}{%- assign submenu_show_featured = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if submenu_show_products == nil -%}{%- assign submenu_show_products = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if submenu_show_icons == nil -%}{%- assign submenu_show_icons = true -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%} ── Render Submenu Panels ── {%- endcomment -%}
{%- for link in linklists[menu].links -%}
  {%- if link.links.size > 0 -%}
    {%- render 'casa-submenu-panel',
      link: link,
      panel_id: link.handle,
      submenu_product_limit: submenu_product_limit,
      drawer_glassmorphic: drawer_glassmorphic,
      show_badges: _submenu_show_badges,
      show_featured: submenu_show_featured,
      show_products: submenu_show_products,
      show_icons: submenu_show_icons,
      featured_label_support: featured_label_support,
      support_title: support_title,
      support_description: support_description,
      support_email: support_email,
      support_phone: support_phone,
      support_chat_label: support_chat_label,
      support_chat_link: support_chat_link,
      support_btn_text: support_btn_text,
      support_btn_link: support_btn_link
    -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ── Drawer Overlay ──
     backdrop-filter is gated on .is-settled (set by casa-navigation.js
     once the drawer's slide finishes) so iOS never ANIMATES or slides a
     live blur: `transition: all` used to tween blur 0→4px over 300ms,
     re-blurring the full viewport every frame over playing videos — the
     compositor stall behind the 1–2s burger-tap freeze (2026-07-04).
     Closed state stays blur-free (visibility: hidden alone does not free
     a backdrop-filter compositing layer). */
  .casa-drawer-overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    z-index: 99998;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: opacity 0.3s, visibility 0.3s;
  }
  .casa-drawer-overlay.active {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
  }
  .casa-drawer-overlay.active.is-settled {
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  /* ── Drawer Panel ── */
  .casa-drawer {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 340px;
    height: 100%;
    /* Brand v1 frosted Ink — Ink family but tuned lighter and more
       frosted than the previous 0.86/0.90 + 48px blur. Drops opacity
       to 0.72 → 0.78 so the page underneath actually shows through
       the frost, and bumps blur to 72px / saturate 180% so the
       diffusion reads as real frosted glass instead of "semi-solid
       dark panel." Math (white page behind):
         top    @ 0.72 → ~rgb(79, 79, 82), white text ≈ 4.6:1 (WCAG AA)
         bottom @ 0.78 → ~rgb(64, 64, 67), white text ≈ 6.4:1 (WCAG AA+)
       Gradient is darker at the bottom because the items list lives
       there — small body text needs the higher-contrast end. Over
       Ink-mood pages (Portal hero) the frost stays near-Ink, which
       is correct. */
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 20, 28, 0.72) 0%, rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.78) 100%);
    box-shadow:
      4px 0 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    z-index: 99999;
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--casa-paper);
  }
  .casa-drawer.active {
    transform: translateX(0);
  }
  /* Frost arrives only once the slide has settled (.is-settled from
     casa-navigation.js): a 72px backdrop-filter MOVING with the slide
     re-samples + re-blurs its backdrop every frame on iOS — the 2026-07-04
     burger-tap compositor stall. Rasters once, static. Also keeps the
     closed drawer from holding a permanent blur layer (same fix the
     overlay above got in 0cfe1ea5; the panel never did). Close drops
     .is-settled synchronously, so the slide-out is blur-free too.
     perf-justified: static-only blur while user is actively in the
     drawer; brand-frosted Ink is the chrome identity */
  .casa-drawer.active.is-settled {
    backdrop-filter: blur(72px) saturate(180%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(72px) saturate(180%);
  }
  /* Slide-in face: the panel wears near-solid Ink while it moves (the
     frost only rasters at .is-settled — without this, page text reads
     through the 0.72 gradient for ~300ms), then cross-fades away to
     reveal the frost. Opacity-only, compositor-cheap; symmetrically
     re-covers the blur-free slide-out when close drops .is-settled.
     z-index:-1 paints above the panel's own background but below all
     content (the drawer's fixed+z-index creates the stacking context). */
  .casa-drawer__frost-cover {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18, 18, 25, 0.97) 0%, rgba(9, 9, 13, 0.98) 100%);
    opacity: 1;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .casa-drawer.is-settled .casa-drawer__frost-cover {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .casa-drawer__frost-cover { transition: none; }
  }

  /* Ambient glow - uses drawer accent color */
  .casa-drawer::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 200px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(var(--casa-drawer-accent-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .casa-drawer::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 200px;
    height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(var(--casa-glow-secondary-rgb, 94, 10, 2), 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ── Header ── */
  .casa-drawer__header {
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .casa-drawer__logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: var(--drawer-logo-height, 28px);
  }
  .casa-drawer__logo-img {
    height: var(--drawer-logo-height, 28px);
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    /* Flatten dark monochrome logo to white so it reads on the
       Ink drawer surface. brightness(0) crushes any image to
       pure black regardless of original tones; invert(1) flips
       that to pure white. The merchant uploads their standard
       dark logo (same asset as the header) — no separate white
       asset needed. */
    filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
  }
  .casa-drawer__logo-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--casa-paper);
  }
  .casa-drawer__close {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    color: white;
  }
  .casa-drawer__close:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }

  .casa-drawer__header-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__header-btn {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    color: white;
  }
  .casa-drawer__header-btn:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }

  /* ── Content (scrollable) ── */
  .casa-drawer__content {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    /* Keep the gesture in the menu. Without containment, a swipe that
       reaches either end of this list chains out and scrolls the PAGE
       instead — which is what made the background move while the menu was
       open, and why the menu never scrolled far enough to reach the last
       item. */
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Body lock applied by casa-navigation.js while the drawer is open. The
     negative `top` it sets holds the page visually where the customer left
     it; position:fixed is what actually stops iOS touch scrolling. */
  body.casa-nav-drawer-locked {
    position: fixed;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .casa-drawer__content::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
  .casa-drawer__content::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  .casa-drawer__content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 4px; }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     LEVEL 1 — BRAND INTRO
     Italic-gradient shimmer headline that opens the drawer with a
     brand moment. Mirrors the desktop megamenu featured top-bar.
     clamp() font-size guarantees one-line fit at the narrowest
     drawer (340px = 308px content). NEVER wraps.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .casa-drawer-intro {
    /* Eyebrow dropped — drawer header already displays the Seoul Glow Lab
       logo + wordmark, so a second "SEOUL GLOW LAB" line below it was
       redundant and hard to read on light backgrounds. The italic-
       gradient headline IS the brand-voice opener; it carries the
       brand moment alone. */
    padding: 16px 16px 16px;
  }
  .casa-drawer-intro__headline {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 8vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    /* Casa Paper #FAFAF7 — brand off-white, NOT pure #FFF (per locked
       brand decision: "get rid of the white"). Matches desktop
       megamenu's --casa-section-text pattern. */
    color: var(--casa-paper);
    margin: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .casa-drawer-intro__headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 800;
    background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #B0C3FA, #5E0A02, #F2FFA0, #5E0A02, #B0C3FA);
    background-size: 200% 100%;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    /* perf-justified: paused by default, runs only while the drawer is
       open — background-position keyframes on clipped text used to tick
       forever inside the CLOSED drawer (the gap aa5ad747 left). */
    animation: casa-drawer-intro-shimmer 6s linear infinite;
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }
  .casa-drawer.active .casa-drawer-intro__headline em {
    animation-play-state: running;
  }
  @keyframes casa-drawer-intro-shimmer {
    0%   { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    100% { background-position: 200% 50%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .casa-drawer-intro__headline em { animation: none; }
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     LEVEL 1 — QUICK ACTIONS
     Search · Account · Cart. 3-column grid; 64pt min-height
     touch targets. Cart badge fades in when cart.item_count > 0.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .casa-drawer-quick-actions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 0 16px 8px;
  }
  /* Flat tab-bar treatment: no per-button card so they don't
     read as raised keyboard keys. Background fades in only on
     hover/active/focus as touch feedback. */
  .casa-drawer-quick-action {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 12px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.18s ease;
    min-height: 56px;
  }
  .casa-drawer-quick-action:hover,
  .casa-drawer-quick-action:active,
  .casa-drawer-quick-action:focus-visible {
    background: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.06);
  }
  .casa-drawer-quick-action:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--casa-drawer-accent, #B0C3FA);
    outline-offset: -2px;
  }
  .casa-drawer-quick-action svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    color: var(--casa-paper);
  }
  .casa-drawer-quick-action__label {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(250, 250, 247, 0.85);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  /* Icon + badge wrapper — sized to the 18px glyph so the absolutely-
     positioned badge anchors to the CART ICON, not the whole grid cell.
     Cell-anchored (top/right: 6px) left the count floating in the cell
     corner, far from the centered icon, so it didn't read as a cart
     count. */
  .casa-drawer-quick-action__icon-wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .casa-drawer-quick-action__badge {
    position: absolute;
    /* Centered on the icon's top-right corner — the recognized
       "count on the cart" position. Robust for 1- or 2-digit counts:
       the pill grows symmetrically about the corner. */
    top: 0;
    left: 100%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    min-width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    padding: 0 4px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    /* Solid brand purple to match the header cart bubble (which uses
       --casa-cart-bubble-bg, default #B0C3FA). --casa-drawer-accent is
       the drawer's own accent token (same #B0C3FA default, used for the
       focus outline + glows). Solid purple clears WCAG AA for the digits
       (Paper on #B0C3FA ≈ 5.2:1) — the old purple→pink gradient dipped to
       ~3.5:1 at the pink stop. Paper text, not pure #fff (locked brand). */
    background: var(--casa-drawer-accent, #B0C3FA);
    color: var(--casa-paper, #FAFAF7);
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
    /* Ink ring detaches the pill from the cart glyph it overlaps. */
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.92);
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     LEVEL 1 — TOP-LEVEL ROWS
     Each row is a 64pt-min-height drill-down trigger with icon
     chip + title + sub + chevron. All text on one line.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .casa-drawer-top-rows {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 8px 0 0;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row {
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    font: inherit;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    min-height: 64px;
    transition: background 0.18s ease;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row:hover,
  .casa-drawer-top-row:active {
    background: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.04);
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row__icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(176, 195, 250, 0.18), rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.12));
    /* Seoul: nav item icons hidden (was .casa-drawer__nav-icon { display: none }) */
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--casa-paper);
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row__icon svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row__text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row__title {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    /* Casa Paper, brand off-white per locked decision. */
    color: var(--casa-paper);
    /* Hard rule: NEVER wraps to a second line. Ellipsis if a long
       merchant-added title overruns the available row width. */
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row__sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(250, 250, 247, 0.5);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row__arrow {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: rgba(250, 250, 247, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row__arrow svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }
  .casa-drawer-top-row:hover .casa-drawer-top-row__arrow,
  .casa-drawer-top-row:active .casa-drawer-top-row__arrow {
    transform: translateX(2px);
    color: var(--casa-paper);
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     LEVEL 1 — LOCALE FOOTER
     Tappable button row that opens the shared casa-localization-
     drawer. Mono UPPERCASE spec-register on the left, chevron on
     the right (signals "opens a panel"). Compact 36pt-min row
     instead of a 64pt full-bleed strip — earns its space as a
     control, not a passive label.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.18s ease;
    /* 44pt min height to clear iOS/Material touch target floor */
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer:hover,
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer:active,
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer:focus-visible {
    background: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.04);
  }
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--casa-drawer-accent, #B0C3FA);
    outline-offset: -2px;
  }
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer__text {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(250, 250, 247, 0.55);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer__chevron {
    display: inline-flex;
    color: rgba(250, 250, 247, 0.35);
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer:hover .casa-drawer-locale-footer__chevron,
  .casa-drawer-locale-footer:focus-visible .casa-drawer-locale-footer__chevron {
    color: rgba(250, 250, 247, 0.7);
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  /* ── Featured Card ── */
  .casa-drawer__featured {
    margin: 8px;
    padding: 7px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--casa-drawer-accent-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.2), rgba(var(--casa-glow-secondary-rgb, 94, 10, 2), 0.15));
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--casa-drawer-accent, #B0C3FA), var(--casa-glow-secondary, #5E0A02), var(--casa-support-primary, #F2FFA0));
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-content {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-visual {
    width: 70px;
    height: 70px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured--clickable {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured--clickable:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-drawer-accent-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.4);
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--casa-drawer-accent-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.3), rgba(var(--casa-glow-secondary-rgb, 94, 10, 2), 0.2));
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--casa-glow-secondary, #5E0A02);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-link {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--casa-drawer-accent, #B0C3FA);
    /* Brand book typography for the inline "Shop now" link
       (secondary token — this is a tertiary/link-style CTA). */
    text-transform: var(--button-text-case-secondary, uppercase);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-indent: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    transition: gap 0.2s;
  }
  .casa-drawer__featured-link:hover { gap: 8px; }

  /* ── Navigation Items ── */
  .casa-drawer__nav { padding: 8px 0; }

  .casa-drawer__nav-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 6px 18px;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: inherit;
  }
  .casa-drawer__nav-link:active {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .casa-drawer__nav-icon {
    display: none;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--casa-drawer-accent-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.15), rgba(var(--casa-glow-secondary-rgb, 94, 10, 2), 0.1));
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .casa-drawer__nav-icon--img {
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .casa-drawer__nav-collection-img {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: block;
  }
  .casa-drawer__nav-link:active .casa-drawer__nav-icon {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--casa-drawer-accent, #B0C3FA), var(--casa-glow-secondary, #5E0A02));
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(var(--casa-drawer-accent-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.4);
  }

  .casa-drawer__nav-content { flex: 1; }
  .casa-drawer__nav-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .casa-drawer__nav-subtitle { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); display: block; }

  .casa-drawer__nav-badge {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: white;
  }
  .casa-drawer__nav-badge--hot { background: var(--casa-gold, #f59e0b); color: #000; }
  .casa-drawer__nav-badge--new { background: var(--casa-green, #22c55e); }
  .casa-drawer__nav-badge--sale { background: var(--casa-red, #ef4444); }

  .casa-drawer__nav-arrow {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  /* ── Divider ── */
  .casa-drawer__divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), transparent);
    margin: 8px 20px;
  }

  /* ── Quick Links ── */
  .casa-drawer__secondary { padding: 8px 20px 16px; }
  .casa-drawer__secondary-title {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__secondary-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__secondary-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 100px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 12px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .casa-drawer__secondary-link:active {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-drawer-accent-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.3);
    color: white;
  }

  /* ── Secondary Nav (extra pages menu) ── */
  .casa-drawer__secondary-nav { padding: 8px 20px 16px; }
  .casa-drawer__secondary-nav .casa-drawer__secondary-link {
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__secondary-nav .casa-drawer__secondary-link svg {
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  /* ── Footer ── */
  .casa-drawer__footer {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Locale/Currency Button */
  .casa-drawer__locale-btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: white;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .casa-drawer__locale-btn:active {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-drawer-accent-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.3);
  }
  .casa-drawer__locale-country {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .casa-drawer__locale-currency {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .casa-drawer__social {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .casa-drawer__social-link {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    color: white;
  }
  .casa-drawer__social-link:active {
    background: var(--casa-drawer-accent, #B0C3FA);
    border-color: var(--casa-drawer-accent, #B0C3FA);
  }
  .casa-drawer__copyright {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     GLASSMORPHIC DRAWER — Apple-style frosted glass
     All colors driven by --casa-glass-* CSS custom properties
     set in casa-header.liquid from customizer settings.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  /* Glass variant NEUTRALIZED to brand Ink.
     Per brand book "two surfaces only — Paper or Ink", the glass
     theme rendered the panel as a translucent light surface using
     merchant-set --casa-glass-tint-rgb (was rgb(250,250,250) at 0.9
     opacity) — white text on light glass = invisible. Forced to the
     same brand Casa Ink as the default panel. The merchant's
     drawer_glassmorphic setting still toggles the class but no
     longer changes the visual surface. */
  .casa-drawer--glass {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #14141C 0%, #0A0A0F 100%);
    color: var(--casa-paper);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass.active {
    /* No backdrop-filter — solid Ink panel doesn't need it, and the
       blur was a major GPU cost. */
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass::before,
  .casa-drawer--glass::after {
    display: none;
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__header {
    border-bottom-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.25);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__logo,
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__logo-text {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__close,
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__header-btn {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.35);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__close:hover,
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__header-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.55);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__featured {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-card-bg-rgb), 0.4);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.25);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__featured::before {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.12), rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.06), rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.03));
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__featured-label {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__featured-desc {
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-muted-rgb), 0.75);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__featured-link {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__featured-placeholder {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.3);
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-muted-rgb), 0.5);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__nav-link {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__nav-link:active {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.3);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__nav-icon {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.4);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__nav-link:active .casa-drawer__nav-icon {
    background: var(--casa-glass-icon-active);
    box-shadow: none;
    color: var(--casa-glass-card-bg);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__nav-subtitle {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__nav-arrow {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.3);
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__divider {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.35), transparent);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__secondary-title {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__secondary-link {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-card-bg-rgb), 0.25);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__secondary-link:active {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.45);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.5);
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__footer {
    border-top-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.25);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__locale-btn {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-card-bg-rgb), 0.25);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__locale-btn:active {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.45);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__locale-currency {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__social-link {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-card-bg-rgb), 0.25);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__social-link:active {
    background: var(--casa-glass-icon-active);
    border-color: var(--casa-glass-icon-active);
    color: var(--casa-glass-card-bg);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__copyright {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }
  .casa-drawer--glass .casa-drawer__content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     RESPONSIVE: VERY SMALL MOBILE (375px and below)
     Optimized for iPhone SE and similar small devices
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  @media (max-width: 375px) {
    .casa-drawer {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .casa-drawer__header {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__logo { height: var(--drawer-logo-height, 24px); }
    .casa-drawer__logo-img { height: var(--drawer-logo-height, 24px); }
    .casa-drawer__logo-text {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__close,
    .casa-drawer__header-btn {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__header-actions {
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__featured {
      margin: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__featured-visual {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__featured-content {
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__featured-label {
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__featured-desc {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__featured-link {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-link {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-icon {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-icon svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-title {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-subtitle {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-badge {
      font-size: 8px;
      padding: 3px 8px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-arrow {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__divider {
      margin: 6px 16px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__secondary {
      padding: 6px 16px 12px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__secondary-title {
      font-size: 9px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__secondary-links {
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__secondary-link {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__footer {
      padding: 12px 16px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__locale-btn {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__social {
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__social-link {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__social-link svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__copyright {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     RESPONSIVE: EXTRA SMALL MOBILE (320px and below)
     For very narrow screens
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  @media (max-width: 320px) {
    .casa-drawer__header {
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__logo { height: var(--drawer-logo-height, 20px); }
    .casa-drawer__logo-img { height: var(--drawer-logo-height, 20px); }
    .casa-drawer__logo-text {
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__close,
    .casa-drawer__header-btn {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__featured {
      margin: 10px;
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__featured-visual {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-link {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-title {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__nav-badge {
      display: none;
    }

    .casa-drawer__secondary {
      padding: 4px 12px 10px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__secondary-link {
      padding: 6px 10px;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__footer {
      padding: 10px 12px;
    }

    .casa-drawer__social-link {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
    }
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     OVERLAY PRIORITY GUARD
     When the mobile drawer is open, nothing should layer on top.
     This block hides known third-party + in-theme overlays that
     would otherwise compete for z-index priority. The drawer
     itself runs at z-index 99998-100000 (overlay/drawer/submenu)
     to beat all in-theme modals; this block additionally hides
     third-party widgets we can't control via z-index alone.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  body.casa-drawer-active .klaviyo-form,
  body.casa-drawer-active [class*="klaviyo-form"],
  body.casa-drawer-active .kl-private-reset-css-Xuajs1,
  body.casa-drawer-active iframe[id^="klaviyo"],
  body.casa-drawer-active iframe[name^="klaviyo"],
  body.casa-drawer-active [class*="needsclick"][class*="kl-private"],
  body.casa-drawer-active #shopify-pc__banner,
  body.casa-drawer-active #shopify-pc__prefs,
  body.casa-drawer-active #shopify-section-cookie-banner,
  body.casa-drawer-active [class*="cookie-banner"],
  body.casa-drawer-active [id*="cookie-banner"],
  body.casa-drawer-active [class*="cookie-consent"],
  body.casa-drawer-active [id*="cookie-consent"],
  body.casa-drawer-active #tidio-chat,
  body.casa-drawer-active [class*="intercom"],
  body.casa-drawer-active [class*="gorgias"],
  body.casa-drawer-active [id*="drift-frame"],
  body.casa-drawer-active .casa-locale-drawer,
  body.casa-drawer-active .casa-locale-backdrop,
  body.casa-drawer-active .casa-quickview-modal-wrapper,
  body.casa-drawer-active [class*="casa-pdp-gallery"][class*="lightbox"],
  body.casa-drawer-active [class*="casa-lookbook"][class*="lightbox"] {
    visibility: hidden !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
  }

  /* Hide the PAGE header action buttons (search / account / cart /
     locale) that sit behind the drawer panel. Necessary because
     the drawer is now lighter-frosted (0.72/0.78 + 72px blur), so
     the page header's icons would otherwise bleed through the
     glass and read as ghosted duplicates of the drawer's own
     quick-action row. The header LOGO area still bleeds through
     because the drawer renders its own logo at the same y-offset
     — that's intentional (the logo IS the brand mark, not a
     control). */
  body.casa-drawer-active .casa-header__search-btn,
  body.casa-drawer-active .casa-header__account-btn,
  body.casa-drawer-active .casa-header__cart-btn,
  body.casa-drawer-active .casa-header__locale-btn {
    visibility: hidden !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SUBMENU ACTIVE STATE
     When any Level 2 submenu is open, hide the parent drawer
     behind it. The submenu panel is partial-frost (0.86 opacity),
     so without this the drawer's top-row chevrons would bleed
     through. visibility: hidden preserves the drawer's DOM /
     scroll position so back-arrow returns the user to the same
     spot. JS toggles `body.casa-submenu-active` in
     casa-navigation.js openSubmenu/closeSubmenu.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  body.casa-submenu-active .casa-drawer {
    visibility: hidden;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
